"Website: <ulink url=\"http://gwenview.sourceforge.net/\">http://gwenview."
"sourceforge.net/</ulink>"
msgstr ""
"តំបន់​បណ្ដាញ ៖ <ulink url=\"http://gwenview.sourceforge.net/\">http://gwenview."
"sourceforge.net/</ulink>"

#. Tag: ulink
