"jalix.org/projects/showimg/</ulink>"
msgstr ""
"តំបន់​បណ្ដាញ ៖ <ulink url=\"http://www.jalix.org/projects/showimg/\">http://www."
"jalix.org/projects/showimg/</ulink>"

